@* ── Inter-beat silence pacing ─────────────────────────── *@
<div class="row g-3 mb-3">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="card bg-dark text-light border-secondary">
            <div class="card-header text-muted">
                Silence Pacing
                <span class="text-secondary small ms-2">— gap in ms inserted between beats in the combined audio. Set to 0 to disable a tier. WAV path uses native PCM silence; MP3 path uses ffmpeg.</span>
            </div>
